{"documentId":"10oaMdyGBjW2S09lBfgUXW8rM4xmkBri4MeJ-zb7bCLw","title":"ДЕВЯНОСТЫЕ | Стандарт работы с системой лояльности | МХП","revisionId":null,"suggestionsViewMode":"PREVIEW_WITHOUT_SUGGESTIONS","url":null,"body":null,"tabs":[{"tabId":"t.0","title":"ДЕВЯНОСТЫЕ | Стандарт работы с системой лояльности | МХП","parentTabId":null,"index":0,"nestingLevel":null,"iconEmoji":null,"body":{"content":[{"endIndex":1,"sectionBreak":{"sectionStyle":{"columnSeparatorStyle":"NONE","contentDirection":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","sectionType":"CONTINUOUS"}}},{"startIndex":1,"endIndex":52,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1,"endIndex":52,"textRun":{"content":"СТАНДАРТ РАБОТЫ С СИСТЕМОЙ ЛОЯЛЬНОСТИ «ДЕВЯНОСТЫЕ»\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":52,"endIndex":77,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":52,"endIndex":77,"textRun":{"content":"Мытищи · Химки · Пушкино\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":77,"endIndex":78,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":77,"endIndex":78,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":78,"endIndex":95,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":78,"endIndex":95,"textRun":{"content":"1. ОБЩИЕ УСЛОВИЯ\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":95,"endIndex":191,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":95,"endIndex":191,"textRun":{"content":"Вместо бонусного списания действует накопительная скидка для каждого зарегистрированного гостя.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":191,"endIndex":283,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":191,"endIndex":283,"textRun":{"content":"При регистрации гость сразу получает скидку 5% и может использовать её с первого посещения.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":283,"endIndex":434,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":283,"endIndex":434,"textRun":{"content":"За каждые 10 000 ₽ накопленных покупок скидка увеличивается на 1 процентный пункт. Максимальный уровень — 20% (при накопленных покупках на 150 000 ₽).\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":434,"endIndex":516,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":434,"endIndex":516,"textRun":{"content":"Примеры: 0 ₽ — 5%; 10 000 ₽ — 6%; 30 000 ₽ — 8%; 50 000 ₽ — 10%; 150 000 ₽ — 20%.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":516,"endIndex":562,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":516,"endIndex":562,"textRun":{"content":"Скидка действует на всю кухню, бар и кальяны.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":562,"endIndex":563,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":562,"endIndex":563,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":563,"endIndex":601,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":563,"endIndex":601,"textRun":{"content":"2. ПЕРЕХОД СО СТАРОЙ БОНУСНОЙ СИСТЕМЫ\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":601,"endIndex":735,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":601,"endIndex":735,"textRun":{"content":"Гости с большим остатком ранее начисленных бонусов могут обменять их на повышенный уровень скидки — до 10%, в зависимости от баланса.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":735,"endIndex":842,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":735,"endIndex":842,"textRun":{"content":"Для обмена гость обращается к управляющему и предоставляет скриншот карты лояльности с количеством баллов.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":842,"endIndex":987,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":842,"endIndex":987,"textRun":{"content":"Размер скидки при обмене определяет управляющий по утверждённой шкале обмена. До утверждения шкалы персонал не обещает гостю конкретный процент.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":987,"endIndex":988,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":987,"endIndex":988,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":988,"endIndex":1010,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":988,"endIndex":1010,"textRun":{"content":"3. ПОДДЕРЖАНИЕ УРОВНЯ\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1010,"endIndex":1142,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1010,"endIndex":1142,"textRun":{"content":"Накопленный уровень скидки необходимо поддерживать в течение 6 месяцев, иначе он снижается или сгорает согласно правилам программы.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1142,"endIndex":1308,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1142,"endIndex":1308,"textRun":{"content":"Точный порог трат за 6 месяцев и уровень скидки после снижения необходимо дополнительно утвердить и довести до персонала. Не обещать гостям неподтверждённые условия.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1308,"endIndex":1309,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1308,"endIndex":1309,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1309,"endIndex":1333,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1309,"endIndex":1333,"textRun":{"content":"4. ДЕЙСТВИЯ СОТРУДНИКОВ\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1333,"endIndex":1443,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1333,"endIndex":1443,"textRun":{"content":"На столах должны быть актуальные QR-коды для регистрации. Проверять их наличие и работоспособность ежедневно.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1443,"endIndex":1600,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1443,"endIndex":1600,"textRun":{"content":"При принятии заказа официант уточняет, зарегистрирован ли гость. Если нет — предлагает регистрацию, объясняет скидку 5% сразу и помогает зарегистрироваться.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1600,"endIndex":1767,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1600,"endIndex":1767,"textRun":{"content":"Если гость уже зарегистрирован, официант передаёт менеджеру смены номер карты/QR-код и номер стола для применения действующей скидки по принятому в заведении порядку.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1767,"endIndex":1835,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1767,"endIndex":1835,"textRun":{"content":"Перед расчётом проверять корректность применённого процента скидки.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1835,"endIndex":1907,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1835,"endIndex":1907,"textRun":{"content":"Вопросы обмена старых бонусов и спорные случаи передавать управляющему.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1907,"endIndex":1908,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1907,"endIndex":1908,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1908,"endIndex":1917,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1908,"endIndex":1917,"textRun":{"content":"5. ВАЖНО\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1917,"endIndex":2096,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1917,"endIndex":2096,"textRun":{"content":"Старые правила о начислении 390 баллов, списании до 50%, ограничениях списания по пятницам, субботам, праздникам и за контактным баром не применяются к новой скидочной программе.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2096,"endIndex":2166,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2096,"endIndex":2166,"textRun":{"content":"Сотрудники должны объяснять гостям единые условия во всех трёх барах.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2166,"endIndex":2168,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2166,"endIndex":2168,"textRun":{"content":".\n","textStyle":{"italic":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2168,"endIndex":2169,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2168,"endIndex":2169,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2169,"endIndex":2170,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2169,"endIndex":2170,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2170,"endIndex":2189,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2170,"endIndex":2189,"textRun":{"content":"6. БЕСПЛАТНЫЙ ВХОД\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2189,"endIndex":2334,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2189,"endIndex":2334,"textRun":{"content":"Пятница и суббота: до 20:00 вход бесплатный для всех. После 20:00 стандартный вход — 1 000 ₽ за баром, 500 ₽ при бронировании стола с депозитом.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2334,"endIndex":2374,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2334,"endIndex":2374,"textRun":{"content":"Скидка 5–14% — бесплатных проходов нет.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2374,"endIndex":2431,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2374,"endIndex":2431,"textRun":{"content":"Скидка 15–19% — 1 бесплатный проход для владельца карты.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2431,"endIndex":2504,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2431,"endIndex":2504,"textRun":{"content":"Скидка 20% — 2 бесплатных прохода: владелец карты и один сопровождающий.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2504,"endIndex":2660,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2504,"endIndex":2660,"textRun":{"content":"Привилегии действуют в обычные пятницы и субботы. Депозит за стол оплачивается отдельно. Билетные концерты и специальные мероприятия регулируются отдельно.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2660,"endIndex":2661,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2660,"endIndex":2661,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2661,"endIndex":2682,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2661,"endIndex":2682,"textRun":{"content":"7. ПЛАТНАЯ VIP-КАРТА\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2682,"endIndex":2749,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2682,"endIndex":2749,"textRun":{"content":"Стоимость — 50 000 ₽. Срок действия — 12 месяцев с даты активации.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":2749,"endIndex":3003,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":2749,"endIndex":3003,"textRun":{"content":"Включает VIP-статус, скидку 21% на кухню, бар и кальяны и 2 бесплатных прохода на все мероприятия, включая концерты, специальные мероприятия, а также обычные пятницы и субботы. Бесплатные проходы предоставляются владельцу карты и одному сопровождающему.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":3003,"endIndex":3226,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":3003,"endIndex":3226,"textRun":{"content":"Владелец становится членом VIP-клуба. За ним закрепляется индивидуальный менеджер, который оповещает обо всех мероприятиях и предоставляет возможность приоритетно приобрести или забронировать стол до открытия общих продаж.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":3226,"endIndex":3371,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":3226,"endIndex":3371,"textRun":{"content":"Приоритет не означает бесплатный стол: депозит и стоимость бронирования оплачиваются отдельно. Возможность бронирования зависит от наличия мест.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":3371,"endIndex":3462,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":3371,"endIndex":3462,"textRun":{"content":"Карта действует в Мытищах, Химках и Пушкино. VIP-скидка не суммируется с другими скидками.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":3462,"endIndex":3646,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":3462,"endIndex":3646,"textRun":{"content":"VIP-карта предоставляет 2 бесплатных прохода на все мероприятия сети, включая отдельно билетные концерты и специальные мероприятия. Бронирование стола и депозит оплачиваются отдельно.\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":3646,"endIndex":3647,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":3646,"endIndex":3647,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":3647,"endIndex":3648,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":3647,"endIndex":3648,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":3648,"endIndex":3681,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":3648,"endIndex":3681,"textRun":{"content":"8. ДЕПОЗИТ ПРИ ПРИМЕНЕНИИ СКИДКИ\n","textStyle":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1}}},"fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Times New Roman","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT",